                                                                                                                                                                 by Guardforce AI Technology Limited and Rhythm Wings Limited. The address of Guardforce AI Technology Limited and Rhythm Wings
                                                                                                                                                                 Limited is P.O. Box 905, Quastisky Building, Road Town, Tortola, British Virgin Islands and P.O. Box 31119 Grand Pavilion, Hibiscus
                                                                                                                                                                 Way, 802 West Bay Road, Grand Cayman, KY1-1205 Cayman Islands, respectively. Additionally, Mr. Jingyi Tu is the beneficiary of a
                                                                                                                                                                 trust which owns all of the outstanding shares of Guardforce AI Service Limited, a holding company which owns 91,666 ordinary
                                                                                                                                                                 shares. As such, Mr. Jingyi Tu is deemed to be the beneficial owner of our shares held by Guardforce AI Service Limited and has
                                                                                                                                                                 voting or dispositive power over those shares.</span></td>
</tr></table><div>


