                                                                                                                                                                                         owner of Target Sonic Limited which owns 149,095 (post- consolidation) ordinary shares, as such, Mr. Jingyu Tu has voting and
                                                                                                                                                                                         dispositive power of the securities held by Target Sonic Limited. The address of Target Sonic Limited is P.O. Box 31119 Grand
                                                                                                                                                                                         Pavilion, Hibiscus Way, 802 West Bay Road, Grand Cayman, KY1-1205 Cayman Islands.</span></td>
</tr></table><div>

