may become issuable to Streeterville Capital, LLC as of the date of this report. John M. Fife is the sole member of Streeterville Management
LLC, which is the Manager of Streeterville Capital, LLC. Streeterville Management LLC has voting and dispositive power of the securities
held by Streeterville Capital, LLC. Streeterville Capital, LLC has rights under a Convertible Promissory Note dated October 25, 2022,
in the original principal amount of $1,707,500.00, to own a certain number of our Company&#8217;s ordinary shares. Streeterville Capital,
LLC&#8217;s address is 303 East Wacker Drive, Suite 1040, Chicago, Illinois 60601.</span></td></tr>
