    <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The Company paid $13,219,105 to Shenzhen Intelligent Guardforce Robot Technology Co., Limited for the purchase of robots, in which robots amounting to $4,481,346 had yet delivered, and robots amounting to $2,773,560 were returned by the Company.</span></td></tr>
