company, operating solely and for all purposes as the agent of AI Hong Kong for the deployment of robots and thus, AI Macau has no independent
revenue of its own.</p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify">&#160;</p></ix:continuation><div>

