</div><div>

</div><ix:continuation continuedAt="_DisclosureOfNoncurrentAssetsHeldForSaleAndDiscontinuedOperationsExplanatory-c0_cont_6" id="_DisclosureOfNoncurrentAssetsHeldForSaleAndDiscontinuedOperationsExplanatory-c0_cont_5"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 35.45pt; text-align: justify">Lease liabilities were measured at
the present value of the remaining lease payments, discounted using the lessee&#8217;s incremental borrowing rate. The weighted average
incremental borrowing rate applied to new leases during year 2022, 2021 and 2020 was <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c2" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:WeightedAverageLesseesIncrementalBorrowingRateAppliedToLeaseLiabilitiesRecognisedAtDateOfInitialApplicationOfIFRS16" scale="-2" unitRef="pure">3.52</ix:nonFraction>%, <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c3" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:WeightedAverageLesseesIncrementalBorrowingRateAppliedToLeaseLiabilitiesRecognisedAtDateOfInitialApplicationOfIFRS16" scale="-2" unitRef="pure">3.49</ix:nonFraction>% and <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c69" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:WeightedAverageLesseesIncrementalBorrowingRateAppliedToLeaseLiabilitiesRecognisedAtDateOfInitialApplicationOfIFRS16" scale="-2" unitRef="pure">3.25</ix:nonFraction>%, respectively.</p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p></ix:continuation><div>

</div><div>

</div><ix:continuation id="_DisclosureOfNoncurrentAssetsHeldForSaleAndDiscontinuedOperationsExplanatory-c0_cont_6"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 35.45pt; text-align: justify">During the years ended December 31,
2022, 2021 and 2020, interest expense of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:InterestExpense" scale="0" unitRef="usd">89,470</ix:nonFraction>, $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c4" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:InterestExpense" scale="0" unitRef="usd">109,848</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c5" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:InterestExpense" scale="0" unitRef="usd">146,273</ix:nonFraction> arising from lease liabilities was included in finance costs,
respectively. Depreciation expense related to right-of-use assets was $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:DepreciationRightofuseAssets" scale="0" unitRef="usd">1,991,447</ix:nonFraction>, $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c4" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:DepreciationRightofuseAssets" scale="0" unitRef="usd">2,279,722</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c5" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:DepreciationRightofuseAssets" scale="0" unitRef="usd">2,506,446</ix:nonFraction>, respectively during the years
ended December 31, 2022, 2021 and 2020.</p></ix:continuation><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p><div>

</div><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" continuedAt="_DisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutIntangibleAssetsExplanatory-c0_cont_1" escape="true" name="ifrs-full:DisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutIntangibleAssetsExplanatory"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
