Rate: Single weighted average discount rate is <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c2" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:ActuarialAssumptionOfDiscountRates" scale="-2" unitRef="pure">3.31</ix:nonFraction>% per year based on the zero coupon yield rate of government bonds in Thailand from
the Thai Bond Market Association (Thai BMA) as of December 31, 2022. Duration (or single weighted average remaining time to retire) is
<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c368" format="ixt-sec:duryear" name="ifrs-full:ActuarialAssumptionOfRetirementAge2019">16.40</ix:nonNumeric> years.</span></td>
