</div><ix:continuation continuedAt="gfai_StockholdersEquityDisclosureTextBlock-c0_cont_16" id="gfai_StockholdersEquityDisclosureTextBlock-c0_cont_15"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify">On June 16, 2022, a total of <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c423" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:NumberOfSharesIssued" scale="0" unitRef="shares">3,780,000</ix:nonFraction>
shares were issued to acquire <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c104" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="gfai:EquityInterestsRate" scale="-2" unitRef="pure">100</ix:nonFraction>% of the equity interests in Beijing Wanjia. As a result of the 2023 share consolidation, consideration
became a total of <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c423" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:NumberOfSharesIssuedButNotFullyPaid" scale="0" unitRef="shares">94,500</ix:nonFraction> shares issued.</p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify">&#160;</p></ix:continuation><div>

</div><div>

</div><ix:continuation continuedAt="gfai_StockholdersEquityDisclosureTextBlock-c0_cont_17" id="gfai_StockholdersEquityDisclosureTextBlock-c0_cont_16"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify">On June 16, 2022, a total of <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c424" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="gfai:TotalSharesIssuedDeposit" scale="0" unitRef="shares">9,720,000</ix:nonFraction>
shares were issued as a deposit to acquire <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c425" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:PercentageOfVotingEquityInterestsAcquired" scale="-2" unitRef="pure">100</ix:nonFraction>% of the equity interests in seven Kewei Group companies. On September 13, 2022, the Company
and the shareholders of seven Kewei Group companies signed a termination agreement to terminate such acquisition. After the 2023 share
consolidation, the <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c425" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:NumberOfSharesIssued" scale="0" unitRef="shares">9,720,000</ix:nonFraction> shares issued became <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c426" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="gfai:ReturnedAndCancelledShares" scale="0" unitRef="shares">243,000</ix:nonFraction> shares, were returned and cancelled on February 13, 2023 (see Note 23).</p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify">&#160;</p></ix:continuation><div>

</div><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"></p><div>

</div><!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 155; Value: 1 --><div>
