the year ended December 31, 2020, depreciation expense of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c5" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="gfai:DepreciationExpenseOfRentalExpense" scale="0" unitRef="usd">700,741</ix:nonFraction> relating to the right of use assets was recorded as rental expense.</span></ix:footnote></td>
